---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro"
import Navbar from "../components/navbar.astro"
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro"
---

<Layout title="Promociona para Vender - Portada Inmobiliaria">
  <Navbar />

  <main class="w-full min-h-screen bg-white text-slate-900">
    <section class="relative w-full h-screen overflow-hidden flex items-end">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
        <img
          src="/img/img15.webp"
          alt="Equipo de ventas - Portada Inmobiliaria"
          class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
          width="2560"
          height="1135"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950 via-slate-950/50 to-transparent z-10"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative z-20 px-6 sm:px-12 pb-12 sm:pb-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full text-left">
        <p class="text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-xl font-bold tracking-wider mb-2 uppercase drop-shadow-md"></p>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-6xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-white drop-shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)] leading-tight"></h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pt-16 pb-6 text-center text-slate-800 text-base sm:text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        En Portada Inmobiliaria hacemos que vender tu inmueble sea un{" "}
        <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">
          proceso ágil, seguro y sin complicaciones
        </strong>
        . Nuestro equipo se encarga de cada detalle con{" "}
        <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">
          eficiencia y compromiso
        </strong>
        , para que obtengas los mejores resultados en el menor tiempo posible.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-700 font-semibold">
        Confía en nosotros para darle valor y visibilidad a tu propiedad.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 relative z-20">
      <div class="bg-white border-2 border-slate-300 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-2xl shadow-slate-300">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 uppercase">
            ¿QUIERES VENDER{" "}
            <span class="text-red-600 italic font-black">TU INMUEBLE?</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold mt-2">
            Déjanos tus datos para guiarte en este proceso
          </p>
        </div>

        <form class="space-y-6" action="#" method="POST">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
                Nombres y apellidos
              </label>
              <input
                type="text"
                required
                placeholder="Tu nombre completo"
                class="w-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-slate-950 font-medium placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-red-600 transition-colors"
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
                Teléfono
              </label>
              <input
                type="tel"
                required
                placeholder="Número de contacto"
                class="w-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-slate-950 font-medium placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-red-600 transition-colors"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
                Correo Electrónico
              </label>
              <input
                type="email"
                required
                placeholder="tucorreo@email.com"
                class="w-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-slate-950 font-medium placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-red-600 transition-colors"
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
                Ciudad o Municipio
              </label>
              <input
                type="text"
                required
                placeholder="Ej. Medellín"
                class="w-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-slate-950 font-medium placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-red-600 transition-colors"
              />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label class="block text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
                Barrio o Sector
              </label>
              <input
                type="text"
                required
                placeholder="Ej. El Poblado"
                class="w-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-slate-950 font-medium placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-red-600 transition-colors"
              />
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block text-xs font-extrabold text-slate-900 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">
              Mensaje
            </label>
            <textarea
              rows="4"
              placeholder="Cuéntanos brevemente sobre tu inmueble..."
              class="w-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-300 rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-slate-950 font-medium placeholder-slate-400 focus:outline-none focus:border-red-600 transition-colors resize-none"
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-slate-100 border-2 border-slate-300 rounded-2xl p-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <input
                type="checkbox"
                id="robot"
                required
                class="w-5 h-5 accent-red-600 rounded cursor-pointer"
              />
              <label
                for="robot"
                class="text-sm text-slate-900 font-bold cursor-pointer"
              >
                No soy un robot
              </label>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs text-slate-600 font-medium text-center sm:text-right">
              reCAPTCHA <br />
              <a href="#" class="underline hover:text-slate-950">
                Privacidad
              </a>{" "}
              -
              <a href="#" class="underline hover:text-slate-950">
                Términos
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-2">
            <input
              type="checkbox"
              id="tyc"
              required
              class="w-4 h-4 accent-red-600 rounded cursor-pointer"
            />
            <label
              for="tyc"
              class="text-xs text-slate-800 font-semibold cursor-pointer"
            >
              He leído y acepto la{" "}
              <a
                href="#"
                class="text-red-600 font-bold underline hover:text-red-700"
              >
                autorización y tratamiento de datos personales
              </a>
              .
            </label>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center pt-4">
            <button
              type="submit"
              class="w-full sm:w-auto px-12 py-4 bg-black hover:bg-red-600 text-white font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-xl transition-all shadow-xl cursor-pointer"
            >
              Enviar Solicitud
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 text-center">
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 tracking-wider uppercase mb-12">
        ¡Conoce nuestros{" "}
        <span class="text-red-600 italic font-black">beneficios</span> para ti!
      </h3>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8">
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg
              class="w-7 h-7"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.2"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M8 14v3m4-3v3m4-3v3M3 21h18M3 10h18M3 7l9-4 9 4M4 10h16v11H4V10z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 font-medium leading-relaxed">
            Acompañamiento en todo el{" "}
            <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">proceso de venta</strong>{" "}
            con las entidades bancarias.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg
              class="w-7 h-7"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.2"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 font-medium leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">
              Alianza estratégica
            </strong>{" "}
            con los colegas del sector para lograr{" "}
            <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">
              la máxima difusión del inmueble
            </strong>
            .
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg
              class="w-7 h-7"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.2"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 font-medium leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">
              Asesoría de documentación
            </strong>{" "}
            necesaria para realizar{" "}
            <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">la compra o venta</strong>{" "}
            del inmueble.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg
              class="w-7 h-7"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.2"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M3 6l3 1m0 0l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M6 7l3 9M6 7l6-2m6 2l3-1m-3 1l-3 9a5.002 5.002 0 006.001 0M18 7l3 9m-3-9l-6-2m0-2v2m0 16V5m0 16H9m3 0h3"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 font-medium leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">
              Acompañamiento jurídico
            </strong>{" "}
            permanente durante y después de toda la negociación.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow flex flex-col items-center text-center">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg
              class="w-7 h-7"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="2.2"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-900 font-medium leading-relaxed">
            <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">
              Agendamiento y programación
            </strong>{" "}
            de citas perfiliación de clientes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h3 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-red-600 uppercase tracking-wider">
          AVALÚOS
        </h3>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-50 border-2 border-slate-200 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-xl">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-5 bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 shadow-md">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2.2"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-lg mb-1">
                Precisión en el Valor
              </h4>
              <p class="text-slate-800 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">
                Precisión en la determinación del{" "}
                <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">
                  valor de las propiedades
                </strong>
                .
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-5 bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 shadow-md">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2.2"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-lg mb-1">
                Valoración Confiable
              </h4>
              <p class="text-slate-800 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">
                Valoración confiable{" "}
                <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">de su inmueble</strong>{" "}
                con total respaldo profesional.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-5 bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 shadow-md">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2.2"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-lg mb-1">
                Respaldo Gremial
              </h4>
              <p class="text-slate-800 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">
                Afiliados de{" "}
                <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">
                  La Lonja Propiedad Raíz de Medellín y Antioquia
                </strong>
                .
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-5 bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border-2 border-slate-200 shadow-md">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-100 text-red-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg
                class="w-6 h-6"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2.2"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"
                ></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="text-slate-950 font-extrabold text-lg mb-1">
                Convenios Privados
              </h4>
              <p class="text-slate-800 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">
                Convenio con avaluadores privados{" "}
                <strong class="text-slate-950 font-bold">
                  que garantizan la transparencia
                </strong>
                .
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
